SUMMARY:Opening Reception: Traces of Flight
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Sunday\, November 15th\, for the opening of “Traces of Flight\,” a captivating exhibition by artist Azita Shahidi. \nInspired by the beauty\, movement\, and spirit of birds\, Shahidi brings her original imagery to life through a unique combination of printed canvases embellished with acrylic\, markers\, ink\, and pen\, alongside works on paper. Blending image and mixed media\, each piece offers a distinctive exploration of texture\, expression\, and the natural world. Come experience this beautiful collection and celebrate the artistry of Azita Shahidi! \n 
URL:https://njaudubon.org/event/opening-reception-traces-of-flight/
LOCATION:Scherman Hoffman Wildlife Sanctuary\, 11 Hardscrabble Rd\, Bernardsville\, NJ\, 07924\, United States
