SUMMARY:Indoor Holiday Mini Sessions at Lorrimer Sanctuary 2026
DESCRIPTION:We are excited to announce our 2026 event date to photograph Indoor Holiday Pictures at the picturesque Lorrimer Sanctuary in Franklin Lakes on Saturday\, November 21st. It’s our first year photographing on the newly updated nature preserve and we’re looking forward to a magical and fun event\, perfect for the whole family. \nOur backdrop designs include: Holiday in front of the Christmas Tree and Woodland Forest as well as a Solid Warm Pecan. \nCLICK THE FOLLOWING LINK FOR MORE INFORMATION AND TICKETS: Indoor Holiday Mini Sessions at Lorrimer Sanctuary 2026 \n 
